# S3.10 — Current-Semester Baseline Freeze

*Status: BASELINE FROZEN*
*Date: 2026-08-09*
*Scope: Documentation-only freeze. No production code was intentionally modified.*

This document is the **authoritative reference implementation baseline** for the
current-semester AttendanceDash Pro product. After S3.10, the current-semester
implementation becomes the REFERENCE IMPLEMENTATION that all future architecture
and scalability work must preserve until an intentional migration replaces it.

